                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Honestly not a bad game a few years back. This is around the time the game had around 10k active players..... I ran a MASSIVE black squad discord, My team competed in the championship bracket, and we won. Got special skins, in game money and a back ground card saying champion etc etc, Was stoked. streamed the whole event ( although the casters for the event were terrible ) A week later i got a manual ban, mid game for quick scoping people.... Reason: Cheating...\n\nThen every person from my team got banned. 1 by 1, all manual bans for \"Cheating\". We then closed the discord and moved onto other games, we were required to screen record the whole event and even sent all the demos from the team in. all the GOOD players were getting banned, the mods were clearly unhappy. I would not put much time or effort or money into the game, the mods and devs are children. They will ban you for no reason if your good at fps games.",
